      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Windsor%2C_Connecticut"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "East Windsor lies within Hartford County and is part of the Capitol Planning Region, linking it to the state’s political core.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/East_Windsor%2C_Connecticut"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "The town is divided into five villages—Broad Brook, Melrose, Scantic, Warehouse Point, and Windsorville—each with its own historic charm.",
